{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんこんばんは！\n新内眞衣です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/08/19/9620855/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近会社に置いてあるコーヒーを\nブラックで飲むのにハマってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手元には全国ツアーで\n手に入れた各地のお菓子があるので\n更にコーヒーも捗る！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"萩の月×コーヒー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なごやん×コーヒー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もみじ饅頭×コーヒー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部合うな〜〜\n食べ過ぎちゃうな〜〜\n困るな〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんはコーヒーに1番合う\nお菓子はなんだと思いますか？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良かったら教えてくださいね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/08/19/9620855/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/08/19/9620855/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂工事中"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#16は新内眞衣をフィーチャーして\n頂きました！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん\n見て頂けたでしょうか？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"清々しいほど\nOLいじりをしてもらえましたm(_ _)m"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/08/19/9620855/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"OLを兼任するようになって約1年半\n細々と真面目にやってきたことなので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"番組でフィーチャーしてもらっても\n面白くならないんじゃないか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"面白くなっても、いい加減な\n印象がついてしまうんじゃないか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会社の人に\n迷惑が掛かってしまうんじゃないか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"放送日までに様々な不安が\nよぎっていました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも放送を終えて、\nコメントなどを読んでいると"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心強いコメントがたくさん寄せられていて\n安心したし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんは私が思っている以上に\n暖かく見守っていてくれているんだ\nと嬉しくなりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも本当にありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/08/19/9620855/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもOLを生かせるように\n日々頑張っていきたいと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/08/19/9620855/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(富士通さん起動が遅いとか言って\nごめんなさい。\n乃木中の影響力恐るべし)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！ちなみに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"放送後\nツアーにて私に向けられる団扇のネタが\nまた増えました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいちゅん\n眞衣\nOL\nOLBBA\n水泥棒←new!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/08/19/9620855/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初森ベマーズ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"第６話に\n凸急高校のバッテリーとして\n出演しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/08/19/9620855/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はピッチャーでのぞみ役\n伊織はキャッチャーでひかり役"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"事前にこのブログで役名当てクイズを\nやったんだけど、\n案の定正解者０人でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"演技とかドラマとか初心者だし\nまだまだだと学ぶこともたくさんありましたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"現場のスタッフさん含め\n現場チームの雰囲気がとても良かったので\n凄く楽しく撮影出来ました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"短い撮影時間でしたがありがとうございました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また機会があったら演技してみたいな〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/08/19/9620855/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"余談ですが、\nのぞみちゃんは俊足な役なのに\n実際の私は５０ｍ走１０秒台の鈍行で\n何回も走るシーンだけを撮ったのは\nここだけの話・・・"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/08/19/9620855/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国ツアー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遂に折り返しを迎えました〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仙台も名古屋も広島も\n良い思い出がたくさん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"残りは福岡・大阪・東京！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/08/19/9620855/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早いな〜\n怒涛のツアーラッシュですが\n体力を保ちつつもっとクオリティーの高い\nライブにしていきたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"残りのライブに来る方\n楽しみにしていてくださいね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは今日はこの辺でおしまいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このあと24時からbayFMにて\nまいちゅんカフェが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"放送されるので良かったら\n聴いてくださいね〜〜(^_−)−☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/08/19/9620855/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週はあすかちゃんがゲストだよ。"}],"source":"archive"}